pelineDetail?pipelineId=3912d073cafc4178a19d8792c413f364&pipelineRunId=d0ee3f5f3d3f41239bf5c8890dfeb445&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-math/package/3631/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-06-29 20:41:03] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-29T20:40:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T20:41:03+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177711627,"discussion_id":"0412e0a08f32470a5152a9ba54db99bb13fee303","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-06-29T20:42:13+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T20:42:13+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c634e4b985165b4b055f","login":"FelixTang7","object_id":"6822c634e4b985165b4b055f","name":"FelixTang7","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/FelixTang7"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177711857,"discussion_id":"8a8383ac812d6e9ea55b5b09d0286aa142d76e87","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 主要解决 `log_add_exp` 算子在输入值域较小时因 `1+exp(x)` 舍入为 1 导致 `log(1+exp(x))` 计算结果精度丢失的问题。在 API 层增加了对 RegBase 场景下的 format 严格校验，并将原有 format 警告逻辑重构为独立函数；在 Kernel 层引入了 `StableLog1p` 模板结构，通过数值稳定的 `log1p` 实现替代原先直接 `Adds + Log` 的组合，避免小值域下的精度误差。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **新增 `StableLog1p` 模板结构**：在 `log_add_exp_dag.h` 中引入 `StableLog1p<CT, In>`，当 `1+x` 因舍入等于 1 时通过 `x * log(1+x) / ((1+x)-1)` 的公式修正，并正确处理无穷大边界情况；所有计算结构（`LogAddExpSimplifiedCompute`、`LogAddExpSimplifiedWithCastCompute`、`LogAddExpFullCompute`、`LogAddExpFullWithCastCompute`）的 `OpLog` 均替换为 `StableLog1p` 的输出。\n\n- **新增 `CMP_NE_MODE` 常量**：在 Kernel 层添加 `CMP_NE_MODE = 5`（对应 `AscendC::CMPMODE::NE`），供 `StableLog1p` 中的不等于比较使用。\n\n- **API 层 `CheckFormat` 重构与新增**：原有 `CheckFormat` 仅做 ND format 警告，现将其重命名为 `WarnFormat`；同时新增一个严格版本 `CheckFormat`，校验 self/other 与 out 的 format 一致性并拒绝私有 format，仅在 `IsRegBase()` 为 true 时调用并触发错误返回。\n\n- **`CheckParams` 中条件分支**：在 `CheckParams` 末尾增加 `IsRegBase()` 判断，RegBase 场景下调用严格的 `CheckFormat` 校验；非 RegBase 场景则在 `aclnnLogAddExpGetWorkspaceSize` 中调用 `WarnFormat` 仅输出警告。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-29T20:43:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T20:43:16+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177711928,"discussion_id":"9dcc9777cf83d9e13c8fa2f8c61d372f3ceb1d96","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-06-29T20:43:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T20:43:28+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d582053cff786c910efe","login":"rxtfeng","object_id":"6822d582053cff786c910efe","name":"rxtfeng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/rxtfeng"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]